<title>HONG KONG: Peregrine sets warrants on Ng Fung Hong.</title>
<headline>Peregrine sets warrants on Ng Fung Hong.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said on Thursday it has issued 215 million call warrants on shares of Ng Fung Hong Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$8.82	PREMIUM	   22.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.2603    GEARING	   3.6X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	29.JUN.98    MIN EXER LOT    20,000</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG    GOVERNING LAW   HONG KONG</p>
<p>SPOT</p>
<p>PRICE HK$9.30</p>
<p> SETTLEMENT	PHYSICAL SHARES OR CASH AT ISSUER'S DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
